Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:59:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] media: t7-vdin: expose powered PQ LUT shadow diagnostics

Distinguish configured LUT CRCs from the last programmed PQ samples.
Read only reviewed control registers while a powered stream lease is held.
CRC values describe software shadows, never hardware LUT readback.
Select CRC32 and test canonical little-endian samples independently.

Signed-off-by: localhost-copilot <318096335+localhost-copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
